    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8754": {
      "title": "Position Details",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Full-Time Grill Cook - Eagles Nest Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Full-Time Grill Cook - Eagles Nest Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Full-Time Grill Cook - Eagles Nest Job Description Prepare ala carte breakfast and lunch items for students, staff, and guests of Ashland University. Set up breakfast station for the days orders and efficiently transition to lunch. Maintain a clean and organized station throughout service. Stock station and prep additional items as needed. Maintain orders from Grubhub as well as in-house orders. Assist in monthly Inventory counting and monitor stock rotation and expiration to minimize waste. Ability to operate registers and take orders in a timely manner. Assist with monthly inventory for cost of goods. Maintain high levels of sanitation following the Ohio Revised Code for food safety. Required Qualifications High School diploma or equivalent. Strong leadership and supervisory skills. Basic understanding of inventory and stock management. Good communication skills and a positive attitude. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Food Safety certified. Previous work in a high volume environment. Physical Demands Area can be hot and fast paced. Bending, twisting, and standing for long periods. Ability to lift 30 lbs. or more. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/03/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 40 Shift Required? First Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1117P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 08/31/2026 Job Open Date 08/31/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8628 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
