    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8710": {
      "title": "Position Details",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Casual Talon Transport Drivers - Student Affairs Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Casual Talon Transport Drivers - Student Affairs Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Rate of pay for this position is $14.00 per hour. Position Details Position Information Position Title Casual Talon Transport Drivers - Student Affairs Job Description Ashland University is seeking dependable, friendly drivers to join our Talon Transport team. Drivers provide transportation for students, faculty, and staff to destinations throughout Ohio, including airports, medical appointments, internships, government offices, and more. If you enjoy driving and making a difference in the student experience, we’d love to hear from you! Position Details: Flexible, ride-based schedule—claim trips that fit your availability. Minimum commitment of 2 rides per month. Drive a university-owned SUV covered by AU insurance. Required Qualifications Minimum five (5) years of driving experience. Valid driver’s license. Clean driving record. Responsible, patient, and dependable. Comfortable interacting with students from diverse backgrounds. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands Ability to sit for two (2) or more hours at a time. Able to open and close car doors. Able to access and respond to electronic notifications. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/31/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 1-5 Shift Required? Varied Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1116P Number of Vacancies 10 Desired Start Date 08/31/2026 Job Open Date 07/14/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Rate of pay for this position is $14.00 per hour. Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8617 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
