    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8740": {
      "title": "Position Details",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Lyceum Café Lead - Lyceum Café Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Lyceum Café Lead - Lyceum Café Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Lyceum Café Lead - Lyceum Café Job Description Must be available 7:30 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. Monday through Friday. This is a part time, 10-month position (August-May). Position works an average of 34 hrs. per week. Hands-on position assisting the Lyceum Café Manager with daily production needs for our customers. Production of multiple specialty coffee drinks. Assist with ordering, stocking, monitoring food quality and sanitation of the facility. Maintain register and balancing of the cash drawer daily. Monitor student labor and hours. Assist manager with any scheduling needs. Part-time position includes prorated vacation leave, sick leave, and holiday pay only. Required Qualifications High School diploma. Previous barista experience. Food Safety certified or state certified in food protection/Level 2 or willing to certify. Efficient with math and Excel. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Provide a high level of customer service. Ability to problem solve on the fly. Physical Demands On your feet most of the day with the exception of the limited administrative duties. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/31/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 40 Shift Required? First Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1118P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 08/31/2026 Job Open Date 07/22/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8630 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
