    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8325": {
      "title": "Position Details",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Part-Time AM Pasta Server - Student Dining Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Part-Time AM Pasta Server - Student Dining Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Rate of pay for this position is $13.50/hr. Position Details Position Information Position Title Part-Time AM Pasta Server - Student Dining Job Description Prepare pasta, sauces, breadsticks, and toppings needed for daily production. Complete related paperwork to document accurate product usage, and temp logs. Maintain safe food temperatures throughout meal period. Rotation of product, clean up and sanitation of area during and after shift. Perform other duties as requested by management. 7:00 a.m. – 1:30 p.m. Monday-Friday; every other weekend 11:00 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. Required Qualifications Performs the duties in an efficient and positive manner. Meets the objectives of Ashland University and the needs of the student customer. Follows state health department guidelines and dress codes. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Detail oriented, reliable as well as a self-starter. Able to work with little or no supervision. Physical Demands Bending, lifting, standing for long periods. Tolerance to extreme heat when working in and around a kitchen environment. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/01/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 29 Shift Required? Varied Job Duties Job Duty Name Optional cleaning Description of Job Duty Deep cleaning of stations and related areas during shut down and summer break. May be asked to work in other Auxiliary operations as needed. Essential Duty? Yes Percentage Of Time 10 Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1055P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 08/01/2026 Job Open Date 02/26/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Rate of pay for this position is $13.50/hr. Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8171 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
