    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8742": {
      "title": "Position Details",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Full-Time PM Cook - Student Dining Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Full-Time PM Cook - Student Dining Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Full-Time PM Cook - Student Dining Job Description Position works 11:00 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. and every other weekend preparing items for the Student Dining hall, Catering, and concession events. Works with a team of other members to prepare food that is prepared fresh and to our standards. Based on menu mix this position may need to work specific grill positions. Benefits available include vacation, sick time, holiday pay, medical and much more. Required Qualifications High School graduate or equivalent. Ability to work as a team with other members of the staff. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Previous cooking experience in a large volume setting. Knowledge of food safety and sanitation. Physical Demands Lifting up to 50 lbs. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/31/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 40 Shift Required? Second Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1107P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 08/31/2026 Job Open Date 06/18/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8532 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
